WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.110
Invoices: invoices, pro-formas and credit notes numbered in sequence, plus VAT settings.

2
00:00:08.658 --> 00:00:18.600
Under "Invoices & VAT", set the legal name, VAT number and rate; turn on "Issue an invoice after each payment" if you like.

3
00:00:19.153 --> 00:00:26.380
For a pro-forma, click "New pro-forma", add lines with "Add line" and click "Issue".

4
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:30.560
Send the document with "Send to the customer in the chat".

5
00:00:31.107 --> 00:00:37.210
An issued document isn't deleted; voiding keeps its number so the sequence isn't broken.
